{"id":"61ac15dc25814c95","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-game3-best-response.md","title":"ZFC Game3 Best Response","display":"df-zfc-game3-best-response — ZFC Game3 Best Response","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game3-best-response","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game3-best-response"],"display":"df-zfc-game3-best-response — ZFC Game3 Best Response","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-product]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game3-best-response"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game3-best-response</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game3-best-response — ZFC Game3 Best Response"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3579e07be41aa5cd\" href=\"?note=3579e07be41aa5cd\" title=\"58-df-product\">58-df-product</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,\\mathcal S,u,i,s_i,\\sigma_{-i}\\in V\">\\(N,\\mathcal S,u,i,s_i,\\sigma_{-i}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3BestResponse}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3BestResponse}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}best\\text{-}response} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame3BestResponse}_S(N,\\mathcal S,u,i,s_i,\\sigma_{-i})\\leftrightarrow i\\in N\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal S))\\land\\forall j\\in N\\;(\\mathcal S(j)\\neq\\emptyset)\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(u,N,\\mathbb R^{\\prod_{j\\in N}\\mathcal S(j)}\\bigr)\\land\\sigma_{-i}\\in\\prod_{j\\in N\\setminus\\{i\\}}\\mathcal S(j)\\land s_i\\in\\mathcal S(i)\\land \\forall t\\in\\mathcal S(i)\\;\\Bigl(u(i)\\bigl(\\sigma_{-i}\\cup\\{\\langle i,s_i\\rangle\\}\\bigr)\\geq u(i)\\bigl(\\sigma_{-i}\\cup\\{\\langle i,t\\rangle\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}best\\text{-}response} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame3BestResponse}_S(N,\\mathcal S,u,i,s_i,\\sigma_{-i})\\leftrightarrow i\\in N\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal S))\\land\\forall j\\in N\\;(\\mathcal S(j)\\neq\\emptyset)\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(u,N,\\mathbb R^{\\prod_{j\\in N}\\mathcal S(j)}\\bigr)\\land\\sigma_{-i}\\in\\prod_{j\\in N\\setminus\\{i\\}}\\mathcal S(j)\\land s_i\\in\\mathcal S(i)\\land \\forall t\\in\\mathcal S(i)\\;\\Bigl(u(i)\\bigl(\\sigma_{-i}\\cup\\{\\langle i,s_i\\rangle\\}\\bigr)\\geq u(i)\\bigl(\\sigma_{-i}\\cup\\{\\langle i,t\\rangle\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The opponents' profile has domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\setminus\\{i\\}\">\\(N\\setminus\\{i\\}\\)</span>; adjoining <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle i,s_i\\rangle\">\\(\\langle i,s_i\\rangle\\)</span> produces the full profile at which the payoff function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u(i)\">\\(u(i)\\)</span> is evaluated.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-product","status":"resolved","id":"3579e07be41aa5cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"N,\\mathcal S,u,i,s_i,\\sigma_{-i}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3BestResponse}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}best\\text{-}response} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame3BestResponse}_S(N,\\mathcal S,u,i,s_i,\\sigma_{-i})\\leftrightarrow i\\in N\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal S))\\land\\forall j\\in N\\;(\\mathcal S(j)\\neq\\emptyset)\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(u,N,\\mathbb R^{\\prod_{j\\in N}\\mathcal S(j)}\\bigr)\\land\\sigma_{-i}\\in\\prod_{j\\in N\\setminus\\{i\\}}\\mathcal S(j)\\land s_i\\in\\mathcal S(i)\\land \\forall t\\in\\mathcal S(i)\\;\\Bigl(u(i)\\bigl(\\sigma_{-i}\\cup\\{\\langle i,s_i\\rangle\\}\\bigr)\\geq u(i)\\bigl(\\sigma_{-i}\\cup\\{\\langle i,t\\rangle\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"N\\setminus\\{i\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle i,s_i\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"u(i)","display":false}],"bytes":1379,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2177","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-game3-best-response.md|58-df-zfc-game3-best-response]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","3579e07be41aa5cd"]}